  <jpcrp030000-asr_E00818-000:NotesRegardingGainOnDisposalOfNonCurrentAssetsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:18pt;"&gt;※３　不要資産の売却等によるものであります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp030000-asr_E00818-000:NotesRegardingGainOnDisposalOfNonCurrentAssetsTextBlock>
